        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carlo Pagulayan, Stan Lee, Jack Kirby\n- Organizations: Marvel Comics\n- Products: Elektra, The Incredible Hulk, Hulk\n- Concepts: fictional superheroes, comic book artists\n\nFacts:\n- Hulk first appeared in the debut issue of The Incredible Hulk in May 1962.\n- Stan Lee and Jack Kirby created Hulk.\n- Carlo Pagulayan was born on June 24, 1978.\n- Carlo Pagulayan is a freelance Filipino comic book artist.\n- Hulk is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\n- Carlo Pagulayan has had assignments from Marvel Comics on Elektra and The Incredible Hulk.",
